00:03:17.128 --> 00:03:19.585
vos ha- vos hot ayer tate getun?

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.282
mayn tate hot gehat OFFICEn

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:26.600
dos iz in SECURENI iz geven

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:29.275
me flegt tsegisn mashke

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:33.086
zenen zey geven a por, s'iz geven a COMPANY.

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:38.115
un khuts mit dem hot er gehaltn an arende feld.

00:03:39.623 --> 00:03:43.937
feld fleg men, in, bay di, bay di gvirim

00:03:44.382 --> 00:03:48.088
un er fleg zey, er mit arbetorers, flegn es baarbetn.

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:50.298
s'iz geven a groyse gesheft?

00:03:50.575 --> 00:03:52.830
s'iz geven a zeyer a sheyn lebn.

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:54.956
un vos hot ayer mame getun?

00:03:54.928 --> 00:04:01.199
mayn mame hot nokh bay di rusn geendikt dem COLLEGE oyf, oyf RUSSIAN

00:04:01.206 --> 00:04:02.820
un frantseyzish

00:04:02.927 --> 00:04:09.013
zi iz geven zeyer an ongenemene in der shtot. zenen ale ORGANIZATION fleg zi nemen aynteyl

00:04:09.222 --> 00:04:12.462
zi fleg helfn oyf di yidishe beler

00:04:12.462 --> 00:04:15.972
un helfn kranke, alte mentshn.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:20.251
tomed, keseyder iz zi geven farnumen.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:22.614
zi iz geven zeyer a tikhtike.

00:04:23.228 --> 00:04:26.566
un akhuts mit derinen iz ⟨zenen mir⟩ geven yidn.

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:28.233
me fleg geyn in shul

00:04:28.307 --> 00:04:30.292
⟨geven⟩ yidishe yontoyvim.

00:04:30.602 --> 00:04:32.486
m'hot gemakht a sheyn lebn.

00:04:32.796 --> 00:04:34.714
s'iz geven a groyse shtot?

00:04:35.428 --> 00:04:39.252
s'iz nisht geven keyn groyse shtot, ober s'iz geven zeyer a sakh yidn

00:04:39.664 --> 00:04:43.978
s'iz geven a gantse gas mit shulekhlekh, kleyne shuln

00:04:44.507 --> 00:04:49.799
un, un ikh gedenk vi di ile yidishe yontoyvim

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.166
di

00:04:51.223 --> 00:04:53.464
di ile yidishe

00:04:53.464 --> 00:04:58.608
azoy me fleg geyn in shul arayn, azoy me fleg tantsn, azoy mit di yidishe beler

00:04:58.632 --> 00:05:03.151
purim shpiln mit dem alemen. s'iz geven a yidish, a sheyn

00:05:03.151 --> 00:05:04.582
yidish lebn.

00:05:05.331 --> 00:05:07.226
zogt mir vos ir gedenkt

00:05:07.226 --> 00:05:08.447
als kind

00:05:08.757 --> 00:05:11.586
vegn der heym, vegn di mishpokhe?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:18.251
es iz geven, mayne eltern zenen geven zeyer gebildete mentshn.

00:05:18.696 --> 00:05:22.675
ikh gedenk az se flegn zayn a sakh

00:05:22.675 --> 00:05:25.119
disputn, politishe disputn

00:05:25.125 --> 00:05:28.747
un in shtub hot men geredt yidish, mame loshn

00:05:28.753 --> 00:05:34.046
un oykh rusish un frantseyzish un, un rumenish.

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:37.339
se flegn araynkumen a sakh

00:05:37.339 --> 00:05:43.547
gazetn mit zhurnaln fun alerley shprakhn fun a sakh lender.

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:48.896
ale kinder hobn gelernt. s'iz geven zeyer a muzikalishe familye.

00:05:49.003 --> 00:05:52.130
me fleg zingen un

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:53.733
un tantsn

00:05:53.733 --> 00:05:56.558
un se flegn zikh tsunoyfkumen di mishpokhe

00:05:56.698 --> 00:05:58.096
un me fleg redn

00:05:58.096 --> 00:05:59.893
dos vos ikh gedenk

00:05:59.893 --> 00:06:02.306
fleg men redn fun PALESTINE.

00:06:02.306 --> 00:06:04.556
es iz ales iz geven tsienistn.

00:06:04.832 --> 00:06:08.651
ales hot getrakht un geredt fun PALESTINE az me zol kumen.

00:06:08.651 --> 00:06:11.284
in yene tsaytn se, iz geven

00:06:11.284 --> 00:06:13.916
di, fleg men forn mit di shvartse shifn

00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:17.583
flegn zikh ganvenen keyn, keyn ISRAEL, keyn PALESTINE.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.013
mayne brider hobn oykh

00:06:19.466 --> 00:06:21.306
in velekhe yorn iz dos geven?

00:06:21.066 --> 00:06:27.084
dos iz geven biz, vos, vos ikh gedenk iz geven biz UNK akht, nayn un draysik.

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:29.576
bin geven a kind, nor

00:06:29.576 --> 00:06:32.029
di kinder yorn fargesn zikh nisht.

00:06:32.153 --> 00:06:35.657
vos gedenkt ir fun di kinder yorn? ir zent gegangen in shule?

00:06:35.545 --> 00:06:36.686
OH YES.

00:06:36.844 --> 00:06:43.540
s- dos iz geven, in Sekuren iz geven, hot dos geheysn oyf rumenish SCOALA PRIMARA. dos iz geven di ershte fir

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.259
klasn

00:06:45.484 --> 00:06:51.046
un vos ikh hob gekent. dernokh zenen mir gegangen in dem COLLEGE, in GYMNASIA.

00:06:51.222 --> 00:06:54.354
dos iz geven a, a PARTICULER

00:06:54.394 --> 00:06:56.126
COLLEGE

00:06:56.233 --> 00:07:02.200
un me fleg kumen fun andere greys- groyse shtet, fleg men undz kumen ekzamen- di EXAMINATION.

00:07:02.207 --> 00:07:04.783
un vos hot ir gelernt in di gimnazye?

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:10.135
in gimnazye hot men gelernt ales. m'hot ⟨gelernt⟩ GEOGRAFIA, HISTORY

00:07:10.135 --> 00:07:12.700
lataynish, frantseyzish

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:16.210
daytsh. rumenish iz geven di shprakh fun dem land.

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:20.797
demlt iz dos geven Besarabye. dos iz geven unter dem rumenishn ⟨protektoriat⟩.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:29.808
algebre, khemye, fizik., ale sh- ale d- ales hobn mir gelernt.

00:07:29.916 --> 00:07:34.905
vos hot ir geredt in hoyz mit di brider un shvester un di mame un tate?

00:07:34.573 --> 00:07:39.545
di HAUPTSPRACHE? dos iz geven yidish, di mame loshn.

00:07:40.007 --> 00:07:45.277
nor tsvishn di eltern, hot men tsvishn zey geredt un di eltere brider un shvester

00:07:45.277 --> 00:07:47.707
hot men geredt rusish

00:07:47.707 --> 00:07:49.209
frantseyzish

00:07:49.209 --> 00:07:51.813
rumenish, yidish, HEBREW.

00:07:54.098 --> 00:07:57.737
un vos gedenkt ir fun, fun di

00:07:57.945 --> 00:08:01.887
fun di shtot, fun di andere yidishe kinder? vos hot ir getun mit zey?

00:08:02.957 --> 00:08:07.288
mh s'iz geven zeyer, di EDUCATION iz geven zeyer shtreng.

00:08:07.311 --> 00:08:11.695
me fleg kumen funem COLLEGE, hot men gedarft zitsn un makhn di

00:08:11.695 --> 00:08:13.329
di SHIURIM.

00:08:13.538 --> 00:08:15.197
m'hot gedarft lernen.

00:08:15.197 --> 00:08:17.227
m'hot gedarft muzitsirn.

00:08:17.352 --> 00:08:21.947
m'hot gedarft zitsn baym tish, azoy vi der tate hot geheysn

00:08:21.947 --> 00:08:27.009
s'iz geven zeyer a sheyne shtub mit eduka- g- di EDUCATION iz geven

00:08:27.009 --> 00:08:29.895
dos vikhtikste zakh in der shtub.

00:08:29.895 --> 00:08:31.591
m'hot gelernt di kinder

00:08:31.591 --> 00:08:33.034
oysneyen

00:08:34.429 --> 00:08:36.228
makhn latkelekh

00:08:36.606 --> 00:08:39.198
kokhn, bakn

00:08:39.205 --> 00:08:41.156
zayn a baleboste

00:08:41.517 --> 00:08:44.076
ophitn ale zakhn.

00:08:44.453 --> 00:08:47.805
in shtub hot gedarft zayn tomed reyn, sheyn.

00:08:47.878 --> 00:08:50.482
in dem kabinet fun mayn tatn

00:08:50.482 --> 00:08:53.284
iz nisht ale kinder hobn gekent arayngeyn ahintsu.

00:08:53.284 --> 00:08:56.900
dortn flegn zikh tsunoyfnemen di eltern mit zeyere khaveyrim

00:08:56.974 --> 00:09:01.575
un me fleg disputirn. me fleg muzitsirn un disputirn.

00:09:01.682 --> 00:09:04.916
ir gedenkt bobes un zeydes?

00:09:05.091 --> 00:09:05.861
NO.

00:09:07.268 --> 00:09:10.496
s'iz geven a babe, nor zey zenen

00:09:10.496 --> 00:09:14.470
antlofn. ales iz geven d- di rusishe REVOLUTION.

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:19.195
mayn eltern zenen geboyrn in, a mol iz dos geven Besarabye iz dos geven a mol

00:09:19.195 --> 00:09:20.441
Rusland.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:26.038
iz flegn zey redn oyf rusish un oyf frantseyzish. nisht ales iz geven

00:09:26.038 --> 00:09:29.081
farshtanen. mir in shtub hobn geredt yidish.

00:09:29.661 --> 00:09:30.881
un

00:09:30.881 --> 00:09:35.790
di mame nisht gehat a, a mame do- ir ho- gedenkt nisht keyn babes un zeydes?

00:09:34.521 --> 00:09:35.606
NO.

00:09:35.606 --> 00:09:37.215
a zeyde y- oh yo.

00:09:37.356 --> 00:09:41.754
mayn mame's foter, yo, gedenk ikh.

00:09:41.828 --> 00:09:43.661
er iz geven a sheyner yid.

00:09:43.701 --> 00:09:45.365
vos iz zayn nomen geven?

00:09:46.063 --> 00:09:47.815
M- Meshulem.

00:09:47.815 --> 00:09:49.703
Meshulem ⟨GETER⟩.

00:09:49.945 --> 00:09:53.044
a sheyner yid. er iz dakht zikh mir geven a DATI

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:57.037
dakht zikh az er fleg geyn tomed mit a

00:09:57.037 --> 00:09:58.426
KIPA oyf dem kop.

00:09:58.703 --> 00:10:02.190
un er fleg mikh kushn in, in kop fleg er mikh kushn.

00:10:03.698 --> 00:10:06.999
nor zey hobn gevoynt in a andere shtot

00:10:07.174 --> 00:10:09.800
iz fleg er kumen eynike mol

00:10:10.195 --> 00:10:13.429
nor di babes gedenk ikh nisht.

00:10:14.413 --> 00:10:19.098
di shabes un di yontoyvim. vos gedenkt ir vegn dem?

00:10:18.362 --> 00:10:20.786
oh, oh.

00:10:23.205 --> 00:10:25.679
fraytik fleg men bentshn likht

00:10:27.357 --> 00:10:29.815
mit vayse tishtekher oyf di tishn.

00:10:32.031 --> 00:10:35.147
di FAMILY fleg ale zitsn tsuzamen.

00:10:35.153 --> 00:10:37.644
me fleg NACHTMAHL esn

00:10:37.684 --> 00:10:39.655
un dernokh fleg men zingen

00:10:39.655 --> 00:10:41.154
yidishe lider

00:10:42.696 --> 00:10:45.612
der tate hot zeyer lib gehat tsu zingen.

00:10:45.612 --> 00:10:48.866
er fleg gibn dem ton, un ale kinder flegn zingen

00:10:49.227 --> 00:10:52.438
shabes iz geven shabes. shabes

00:10:52.438 --> 00:10:54.131
iz geven yontev.

00:10:54.188 --> 00:10:59.678
me fleg nisht lernen. me fleg nit shraybn. me fleg nisht tun gornisht. me fleg geyn tsu khavertes.

00:10:59.678 --> 00:11:02.411
me fleg zitsn oyf der gas. me fleg

00:11:02.411 --> 00:11:05.539
zingen un shpiln, kinder.

00:11:05.258 --> 00:11:08.441
ir gedenkt, a lidele vos ir hot gezungen?

00:11:09.158 --> 00:11:10.158
in hoyz?

00:11:10.064 --> 00:11:11.262
in der heym?

00:11:11.262 --> 00:11:12.823
di ale yidishe

00:11:11.424 --> 00:11:12.844
fraytik bay nakht?

00:11:12.823 --> 00:11:14.679
di ale yidishe lidelekh

00:11:14.679 --> 00:11:16.490
lign in hartsn.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.464
tif, tif in ⟨hartsn⟩.

00:11:18.842 --> 00:11:20.979
ir gedenkt ey- a, a lidele?

00:11:21.441 --> 00:11:23.797
fun yene lidelekh

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.346
yo, ikh ken a sakh lidelekh.

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:27.594
zingt mir a lidele.

00:11:27.381 --> 00:11:29.130
fun yene tsaytn?

00:11:35.008 --> 00:11:38.816
shteyt a khaver, shteyt un trakht

00:11:38.907 --> 00:11:42.574
trakht un trakht un vider trakht

00:11:42.574 --> 00:11:44.934
vemen zol nemen

00:11:44.934 --> 00:11:47.824
un nisht farshemen

00:11:47.824 --> 00:11:52.091
vemen tsu nemen un nisht farshemen

00:11:52.091 --> 00:11:54.141
TUMBALALAY TUMBALALAY

00:11:54.141 --> 00:11:56.111
TUM balalayke

00:11:56.111 --> 00:12:00.036
TUMBALALAY TUMBALALAY, TUM balalayke

00:12:00.036 --> 00:12:02.824
TUM balalayke

00:12:02.824 --> 00:12:06.024
shpil balalayke

00:12:06.024 --> 00:12:10.433
TUM balalayke, freylekh zol zayn.

00:12:10.648 --> 00:12:12.329
un ir flegt ale zingen?

00:12:12.049 --> 00:12:14.940
dos gedenk ikh gut, vayl s'iz geven

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:17.050
 nisht eyn ton.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:20.120
me fleg nemen a por tonen, di brider mit di

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.150
es fleg zayn vi a khor.

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:24.450
se fleg zeyer sheyn oyskumen

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:27.028
un s'iz do andere lidelekh, di ile

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.834
yidishe.

00:12:29.616 --> 00:12:31.464
un ir hot geshpilt

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.178
sheyn vi di levone

00:12:33.666 --> 00:12:35.988
ir hot geshpilt instrumentn oykhet?

00:12:35.877 --> 00:12:38.115
mayn tate hot geshpilt ⟨pyane⟩

00:12:38.222 --> 00:12:43.197
un mayne brider hobn geshpilt en fidl un bas un

00:12:43.197 --> 00:12:46.302
un dos, di shenste vos ikh gedenk fun der heym

00:12:46.302 --> 00:12:50.923
iz in shtub iz geshtanen a groyser, oyf rusish heyst es a samovar

00:12:51.486 --> 00:12:54.925
iz fleg der bruder vos er iz itstert in IZRAIL

00:12:54.925 --> 00:12:57.912
fleg er opnemen dos dekl un fleg gibn a hak

00:12:57.912 --> 00:13:01.212
in dem, dem samovar un fleg gibn dem ton.

00:13:01.212 --> 00:13:03.102
un az m'hot nisht genumen, fleg er zogn

00:13:03.102 --> 00:13:04.592
"heyb on vider a mol.

00:13:04.885 --> 00:13:06.448
dos iz nisht rikhtik."

00:13:09.306 --> 00:13:12.641
s'iz geven a sheyn lebn

00:13:13.086 --> 00:13:15.122
a freylekh lebn

00:13:17.355 --> 00:13:22.293
mit groyse libe. m'hot zikh yeder lib gehat. m'iz geven eygn.

00:13:22.688 --> 00:13:25.748
s'iz, s'iz geven a lebn. s- m- m'hot

00:13:25.748 --> 00:13:28.678
m'hot, m'hot gelebt bay d- bay, bay yene tsaytns

00:13:28.678 --> 00:13:31.270
hobn di yidn gelebt zeyer sheyn in Rumenye.

00:13:31.564 --> 00:13:36.789
di mame un tate, zey hobn gehat brider un shvester vos zey hobn gelebt lebn aykh?

00:13:38.134 --> 00:13:43.238
neyn. s'iz geven in Khotin. mir hobn gelebt in SOKYRA- ⟨SECURIANI⟩.

00:13:43.238 --> 00:13:46.968
mayne mumes zenen geven in Khotin

00:13:46.968 --> 00:13:50.458
un mayn tate hot gehat a sakh brider

00:13:50.548 --> 00:13:54.106
a groyse mishpokhe vos zey zenen antlofn in oysland.

00:13:54.106 --> 00:13:57.919
s'iz geven in CARACAS, VENEZUELA. s'iz geven in BRAZIL.

00:13:57.919 --> 00:14:01.511
s'iz geven Rumenye, s'iz geven Estraykh, s'iz geven

00:14:01.568 --> 00:14:05.699
a gr- zeyer a groyse mishpokhe iz geven, a groyse mishpokhe.

00:14:05.699 --> 00:14:07.015
un

00:14:07.015 --> 00:14:09.479
s'iz, ale mentshn zenen geven sheyne

00:14:09.479 --> 00:14:12.449
efsher, efsher gedenk ikh zey als sheyne

00:14:12.449 --> 00:14:14.994
nor ikh meyn az zenen geven ale sheyn.

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:18.498
zogt mir vos ir gedenkt

00:14:18.498 --> 00:14:20.464
fun kindvayz vi ir

00:14:21.784 --> 00:14:23.330
i- ir gedenkt

00:14:23.607 --> 00:14:26.571
filn antisemitizm

00:14:26.779 --> 00:14:28.969
fun onfang ven ir hot

00:14:28.969 --> 00:14:31.295
ongehoybn tsu hern zakhn?

00:14:31.538 --> 00:14:34.732
neyn, biz dem akht un draysikstn

00:14:34.732 --> 00:14:36.876
iz gedenk ikh nisht gornisht.

00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:41.083
ikh veys az in COLLEGE in di, di shul vu mir hobn gelernt zenen geven

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:45.550
rumenishe kinder un, un, un goyishe kinder

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:46.399
un

00:14:47.012 --> 00:14:47.816
neyn.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.219
dos gedenk ikh nisht.

00:14:49.219 --> 00:14:51.506
dem akht un draysikstn yor

00:14:51.506 --> 00:14:53.894
iz gekumen tsu der makht di CUZISTN.

00:14:53.894 --> 00:14:56.001
dos iz shoyn geven natsis.

00:14:56.445 --> 00:15:01.361
demlt hot men ongehoybn tsu makhn REVIZUIRE oyf rumenish hot dos geheysn

00:15:01.361 --> 00:15:02.947
dos heyst, m'hot

00:15:02.947 --> 00:15:05.926
ibergekukt ale dokumentn

00:15:05.926 --> 00:15:08.271
vegn di yidn, farshteyt zikh

00:15:08.271 --> 00:15:12.436
un me zol visn ver zey zenen, vu zey zenen, fun vanen zenen gekumen.

00:15:12.527 --> 00:15:15.795
demlt hot men tsugenumen bay mayn tatn di OFFICEn

00:15:16.375 --> 00:15:19.778
un mayn tate iz kimat geblibn on parnose.

00:15:19.885 --> 00:15:23.574
hobn zey gezogt far vos zey nemen avek di gesheftn?

00:15:24.947 --> 00:15:29.424
ikh gedenk nisht azoy me- daytlekh

00:15:29.424 --> 00:15:31.922
nor, shoyn shpeter

00:15:31.922 --> 00:15:39.904
iz hot men tsugenumen derfar vos mayn tate mit di mame zenen gekumen fun Rusland, dos vos zenen nisht geboyrn in Rumenye

00:15:39.904 --> 00:15:44.297
un khuts mit dem meyn ikh az bikhlal hot men gedarft mutshen di yidn.

00:15:44.387 --> 00:15:46.018
es iz shoyn geven natsi.

00:15:45.906 --> 00:15:47.874
vos gedenkt ir fun

00:15:47.948 --> 00:15:50.861
di tsayt vos ir zent gegangen in, in

00:15:51.289 --> 00:15:52.653
s- shule dan

00:15:52.653 --> 00:15:54.844
in nayntsn akht un draysik?

00:15:56.588 --> 00:16:00.736
ikh m- eygns, ikh gedenk nisht. ikh veys az

00:16:00.736 --> 00:16:03.925
mayn bruder, der YAKOV, YASHA

00:16:03.925 --> 00:16:08.090
er hot gelernt in, in BUCHAREST dakht zikh.

00:16:08.113 --> 00:16:09.997
bay im hot men

00:16:10.223 --> 00:16:13.963
in eyn tog hot men dertseylt az m'hot bay im in

00:16:14.053 --> 00:16:18.057
tsi in AUTOBUS tsi in, tsi in m- n- in CAR

00:16:18.057 --> 00:16:20.746
hot men bay im aroysgerisn di bikher.

00:16:20.803 --> 00:16:24.285
m'hot aroysgevorfn di bikher, un m'hot im aroysgeshlept

00:16:24.285 --> 00:16:25.674
un m'hot im geshlogn

00:16:26.473 --> 00:16:30.063
in Rumenye. dos iz geven ven di CUZISTN zenen geven.

00:16:30.063 --> 00:16:32.423
zey zenen geven epes a yor tsayt, nisht mer.

00:16:32.423 --> 00:16:34.820
⟨nokh hot⟩ men zey ⟨arop⟩gevorfn fun der makht.

00:16:35.097 --> 00:16:36.646
vos gedenkt ir

00:16:36.646 --> 00:16:39.410
vi s'hot zikh gebitn in hoyz

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:40.659
bay aykh?

00:16:40.699 --> 00:16:44.726
s'hot zikh gebitn, di atmosfer hot zikh zeyer gebitn.

00:16:41.289 --> 00:16:42.839
ven zey zenen arayngekumen?

00:16:44.749 --> 00:16:49.248
vos iz geven dos ⟨ergste⟩ vos m- m'iz gevorn shtil.

00:16:49.525 --> 00:16:52.728
m'hot oyfgehert tsu zingen. m'hot oyfgehert tsu tantsn.

00:16:52.728 --> 00:16:56.753
m'hot oyfgehert zikh ontsutun. mayn mame iz geven zeyer a elegante froy

00:16:56.753 --> 00:17:02.541
me fleg, az di kinder oykh flegn onheybn tsu shrayen, tsu zingen mit mayn shvester

00:17:02.541 --> 00:17:04.571
fleg men zogn "shtil sha."

00:17:05.218 --> 00:17:09.358
di tirn zenen geven farmakht. m'hot ongehoybn tsu farmakhn di tirn.

00:17:09.358 --> 00:17:11.374
s'iz geven

00:17:11.374 --> 00:17:16.215
vi azoy ikh gedenk iz di atmosfere iz geven a, a, a ongeshtrengte.

00:17:16.963 --> 00:17:18.449
ir gedenkt dos.

00:17:18.449 --> 00:17:23.319
vos hot ayere eltern aykh gezogt vegn dem, far vos

00:17:23.319 --> 00:17:25.449
s'iz gevorn azoy shtil?

00:17:25.502 --> 00:17:29.782
ikh fleg hern di disputn. ikh fleg hern azoy me leyent di bleter

00:17:29.856 --> 00:17:33.810
un me fleg leyenen vos, vos se tut zikh oyf der velt, un s'iz

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:35.975
az se kumt a shvartse khmare

00:17:36.032 --> 00:17:39.856
az me heybt on tsu hargenen yidn

00:17:39.897 --> 00:17:43.536
un, un tsu, tsu, tsu matern yidn

00:17:43.575 --> 00:17:47.318
un mayn tate iz geven zeyer a gelernter man.

00:17:47.318 --> 00:17:50.909
er hot dos nisht gekent farshteyn az Daytshland

00:17:51.625 --> 00:17:55.877
mit GOETHE, mit, mit azoyne, mit azoyne shraybers, mit azoyne

00:17:55.877 --> 00:17:58.311
s'iz geven bay undz a gvaldike biblyotek

00:17:58.311 --> 00:18:00.000
fleg er zogn

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.879
vi ken dos forkumen?

00:18:01.598 --> 00:18:03.856
ir hot gezogt geto. fun, fun

00:18:03.856 --> 00:18:04.927
ven

00:18:04.927 --> 00:18:08.932
gedenkt ir az ir hot gehert dem ershtn mol vegn a geto?

00:18:09.192 --> 00:18:13.371
ikh meyn ergets in akht nayn un draysik yor.

00:18:13.292 --> 00:18:15.311
un vos gedenkt ir vegn dem?

00:18:15.992 --> 00:18:21.554
ikh, ikh gedenk az, az me fleg, dakht zi- in Daytshland

00:18:21.679 --> 00:18:23.085
tsi in Estraykh

00:18:23.085 --> 00:18:26.839
az, az me matert di shraybers mit

00:18:26.839 --> 00:18:29.311
mit mentshn vos zey zenen

00:18:29.311 --> 00:18:30.965
anti-

00:18:30.965 --> 00:18:32.467
natsi

00:18:32.467 --> 00:18:38.328
me harget, me, me shikt zey aroys, me, dos hob ikh gehert.

00:18:37.963 --> 00:18:42.344
hot ir gevust demolst vos a, a natsi iz?

00:18:42.925 --> 00:18:47.812
ikh eygns NO. ikh hob nisht, ⟨bin⟩ geven a kind. kh'hob gevust az s'iz shlekhte mentshn.

00:18:48.358 --> 00:18:50.343
az s'iz nisht keyn gute mentshn.

00:18:50.923 --> 00:18:56.182
un, un dos, ikh gedenk, mayn tate iz geshtanen, hot geleyent

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:59.796
vayzt oys oyf, oyf, oyf yidish. s'iz arayngekumen der

00:18:59.796 --> 00:19:01.838
undzer tsaytung, di

00:19:01.838 --> 00:19:06.138
hot er gezo- gekhapt baym kop un hot oyfgehoybn di briln un gezogt

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.771
"vi ken azoyns forkumen?

00:19:08.794 --> 00:19:12.377
vi az- vi ken zayn hayntike tsaytns azoyne

00:19:12.377 --> 00:19:14.646
merders? azoy ken forkumen

00:19:14.646 --> 00:19:17.731
azoyne gvaldike geshikhtes?"

00:19:17.805 --> 00:19:21.579
vos hot ⟨er⟩ geleyent in nayntsn akht un draysik?

00:19:21.788 --> 00:19:23.452
vos hot men geshribn

00:19:23.492 --> 00:19:24.768
vos ir gedenkt?

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:27.851
ikh veys nisht. mikh hot men, m-

00:19:27.851 --> 00:19:31.468
meglekh az di eltern hobn nisht, di shvester LIZA

00:19:31.508 --> 00:19:35.889
zey hobn ales gevust UNK. ikh bin geven a kind. ikh hob

00:19:35.929 --> 00:19:40.414
ikh hob mir gehat mayn lebn, mayne khavertes mit mayne bikher mit mayne

00:19:40.414 --> 00:19:43.124
shpilerayen, mit mayn UNK

00:19:43.124 --> 00:19:45.468
bin geven di klenste. ales hot mikh lib gehat

00:19:45.468 --> 00:19:48.801
un m'hot mikh vi a, vi a pitsele fleg men mir

00:19:48.801 --> 00:19:52.294
"Khavele, Khavele, mame sheyne, Khavele"

00:19:52.294 --> 00:19:54.148
ikh hob gezungen un getantst.

00:19:54.627 --> 00:20:00.083
un mayn shvester hot mir dertseylt az, az ikh fleg zingen un tantsn. ikh hob nokh nisht gekent redn

00:20:00.083 --> 00:20:02.682
un geyn, iz fleg ikh tantsn un zingen.

00:20:02.682 --> 00:20:04.793
un tomed UNK fleg ikh di nakht shoyn

00:20:04.793 --> 00:20:05.860
flegn mir zogn

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:09.800
"her oyf shoyn tsu zingen. l- gey shoyn shlofn, UNK genug."

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:12.275
ikh bin geven zeyer a energishe, zeyer a

00:20:12.275 --> 00:20:14.044
a, a tikhtike.

00:20:14.573 --> 00:20:19.545
iz ven hot men aykh ongehoybn tsu zogn "shtil

00:20:20.125 --> 00:20:22.026
zing nisht, redt nisht"?

00:20:21.171 --> 00:20:26.109
ikh meyn in akht un draysikstn yor, tsi s'iz shoyn geven der nayn un ⟨draysikstns⟩ yor.

00:20:25.845 --> 00:20:29.180
un vi hot der lebn zikh gebitn ven

00:20:29.406 --> 00:20:32.758
m'hot avekgenumen ayer tatn's gesheft?

00:20:32.578 --> 00:20:33.669
OH, YES.

00:20:33.726 --> 00:20:38.698
 demlt hot men mayn tatn forgeleygt arbet in Khotin

00:20:39.852 --> 00:20:42.394
un di FAMILY iz ibergeforn keyn Khotin.

00:20:43.142 --> 00:20:46.629
demlt hot zikh shoyn ongehoybn dos matern zikh.

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:48.958
vos hot ir getun mit di dire?

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:53.548
s'iz ales geblibn in SECURENI iz geblibn, un do hot men

00:20:53.892 --> 00:20:57.109
tsi s'iz a eygene tsi a ge- tsi a gedungene

00:20:58.549 --> 00:21:00.871
a gedungene vayzt oys iz dos geven.

00:21:01.114 --> 00:21:04.297
iz zent ir ale gegangen tsuzamen? ale kinder?

00:21:03.325 --> 00:21:10.406
neyn. s'iz shoyn geven di kinder. di eltere hobn gevoynt, tsvey shvester di eltere, hobn gevoynt in, in Yas

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:12.527
zey hobn shoyn gearbet.

00:21:12.527 --> 00:21:16.127
eyn ober tsvey brider zenen geven khasene gehate

00:21:16.268 --> 00:21:20.430
d- YAKOV iz geven in armey

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:22.910
demlt in der rumenisher

00:21:23.085 --> 00:21:27.596
LI- in, in der heym bin ikh geven mit mayn shvester LIZA.

00:21:27.596 --> 00:21:30.389
zi iz elter fun mir mit fir yor

00:21:30.389 --> 00:21:35.685
ikh un LIZA un di eltern zenen mir ibergeforn lebn keyn Khotin.

00:21:36.265 --> 00:21:39.651
dos iz geven dem nayn un draysikstn yor.

00:21:39.572 --> 00:21:42.890
hot ir gemuzt iberraysn geyn in gimnazye?

00:21:44.415 --> 00:21:45.927
OF COURSE.

00:21:46.508 --> 00:21:50.332
dos iz geven mitl nayn un draysik

00:21:50.659 --> 00:21:54.770
un in fertsikstn yor zenen arayn di rusn.

00:21:54.945 --> 00:21:58.122
un biz ir zent aroysgeforn tsu Khotin

00:21:57.831 --> 00:21:58.736
yo

00:21:58.566 --> 00:22:00.422
hot ir gekent geyn in gimnazye

00:22:00.422 --> 00:22:02.044
tsi m'hot aykh opgehaltn?

00:22:02.488 --> 00:22:04.794
neyn, ikh bin geven in gimnazye.

00:22:04.986 --> 00:22:07.983
vos gedenkt ir in gimnazye vegn

00:22:08.462 --> 00:22:10.919
hern antisemitishe zakhn?

00:22:12.681 --> 00:22:15.071
ir gedenkt epes?

00:22:15.128 --> 00:22:17.571
friert flegn zayn khaveyrim

00:22:17.571 --> 00:22:22.043
mit di, mit di rumenishe kinder, mit di, mit di ru- rusishe kinder

00:22:22.043 --> 00:22:24.060
un shoyn demlt hot men zikh shoyn

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:26.559
opgeteylt a bisl, tsi me fleg shoyn zayn

00:22:26.559 --> 00:22:29.403
di yidishe kinder zenen shoyn geven,

00:22:29.403 --> 00:22:31.003
tsuzamen aleyn.

00:22:31.003 --> 00:22:33.781
demlt iz geven in Sekuren

00:22:33.781 --> 00:22:36.876
hobn gelernt di meydelekh mit yingelekh tsuzamen

00:22:36.876 --> 00:22:41.254
nor vi ⟨gevis⟩ iz di meydelekh zenen geven ekster, un di m- yingelekh zenen geven

00:22:41.254 --> 00:22:44.391
yingelekh flegn loyfn zikh shlogn un shpiln futbol

00:22:44.391 --> 00:22:48.419
un di meydelekh flegn shteyn un dertseyln un redn un

00:22:48.419 --> 00:22:49.634
un zingen un

00:22:49.634 --> 00:22:53.599
nor z- k- ts- k- ⟨getsvungt⟩ hot keyner undz, keyner nisht.

00:22:53.599 --> 00:22:57.413
ale lerer zenen geven kimat rus-, goyim

00:22:57.413 --> 00:22:58.693
rumenishe.

00:22:58.716 --> 00:23:04.290
ikh gedenk nor s'iz geven nor di lererin ⟨oyf⟩ frantseyzish iz geven ⟨di Riveles⟩. s'iz geven a yidishke.

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:05.808
zi iz geven fun Belts.

00:23:05.808 --> 00:23:08.902
geven zeyer a simpatishe froy. zi iz geven a yidishe.

00:23:08.925 --> 00:23:12.209
un ale lerers zenen geven rumenishe.

00:23:13.937 --> 00:23:16.280
ir zent aroysgeforn in Khotin?

00:23:16.047 --> 00:23:16.986
yo.

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:18.822
mit di eltern un shvester?

00:23:17.295 --> 00:23:18.284
yo

00:23:18.822 --> 00:23:20.225
vos gedenkt ir dort?

00:23:21.497 --> 00:23:25.409
mayn shvester iz gegangen lernen als a

00:23:25.409 --> 00:23:26.267
a

00:23:26.408 --> 00:23:28.376
a meditsin shvester.

00:23:29.327 --> 00:23:33.779
un mayn tate hot gearbet, es fleg avekforn fun der heym

00:23:33.779 --> 00:23:35.109
ikh m- feld

00:23:35.352 --> 00:23:37.911
er fleg forn tsu di posesors

00:23:38.085 --> 00:23:41.555
un fleg zayn a gantse vokh dortn oyf dem feld.

00:23:41.578 --> 00:23:43.777
eyn mol in der vokh fleg er kumen

00:23:43.777 --> 00:23:46.588
mit a britshke, mit a f- mit eyn ferd

00:23:46.588 --> 00:23:48.271
un brengen

00:23:48.683 --> 00:23:51.225
esnvarg, produktn.

00:23:51.282 --> 00:23:55.919
zeks mit, mit veyts, mit, mit kukuruts, mit

00:23:55.919 --> 00:23:58.045
POTATOES, mit dos

00:23:58.045 --> 00:23:59.544
un

00:23:59.567 --> 00:24:03.780
un ikh bin geven mit der mamen un un mit mayn shvester in der heym.

00:24:03.718 --> 00:24:06.108
zent ir gegangen in SCHOOL dort?

00:24:06.452 --> 00:24:12.470
dos iz, iz dos geven dem nayn un draysikstn yor, epes iz dos geven, mir ho'mir zikh ibergetsoygn ergets in

00:24:12.578 --> 00:24:14.833
in yuli

00:24:14.957 --> 00:24:18.329
di shul hot nisht gearbet, ⟨iz men⟩ nisht gegangen in

00:24:18.329 --> 00:24:22.241
in epes. teykef es zenen arayn di, di rusn in fertsikstn yor

00:24:24.289 --> 00:24:27.863
⟨un az⟩ ikh bin gegangen in di rumenishe S- ge- e-

00:24:27.863 --> 00:24:28.875
COLLEGE.

00:24:28.875 --> 00:24:30.509
yo, ikh bin geven.

00:24:30.533 --> 00:24:33.193
dos iz shoyn geven

00:24:33.553 --> 00:24:36.416
epes der driter tsi der ferder klas

00:24:36.591 --> 00:24:37.884
in Khotin.

00:24:38.532 --> 00:24:41.718
nor s'iz geven zeyer a kleyn shtikl tsayt

00:24:41.718 --> 00:24:45.025
vayl in fertsikstn yor zenen arayngekumen di rumener

00:24:45.025 --> 00:24:47.790
un s'hot zikh opgeshtelt. m'hot oyfgehert tsu lernen

00:24:47.796 --> 00:24:51.480
un dernokh shoyn iz shoyn geven a rusishe shkol- shul

00:24:51.480 --> 00:24:53.730
bin ikh shoyn gegangen tsu di rusn in shul.

00:24:54.107 --> 00:24:56.497
vos gedenkt ir vegn

00:24:57.091 --> 00:24:59.183
dem lebn in Khotin?

00:24:59.183 --> 00:25:00.851
vi s'hot zikh gebitn?

00:25:00.452 --> 00:25:02.606
es hot zikh zeyer gebitn dos lebn.

00:25:03.102 --> 00:25:05.998
 ven di rusn zenen arayngekumen?

00:25:06.105 --> 00:25:10.550
afile a- afile frier, ven ir hot ersht gekumen in Khotin

00:25:06.173 --> 00:25:06.977
oh

00:25:10.550 --> 00:25:12.495
un der tate iz avekge⟨gangen⟩.

00:25:11.218 --> 00:25:14.199
yo, es iz gevorn shtil.

00:25:14.712 --> 00:25:17.794
di shtub iz nisht geven di shtub fun Sekuren.

00:25:18.053 --> 00:25:20.932
es hobn gefelt a sakh zakhn in der shtub.

00:25:21.107 --> 00:25:24.420
s'iz geven zeyer umedik

00:25:24.420 --> 00:25:28.897
vayl mir ze'mir geven keseyder in eynem. s'iz geven a groyse mishpokhe

00:25:28.903 --> 00:25:35.630
un ales iz geven tsuzamen un ⟨pletslekh⟩. ikh bin oykh geblibn aleyn mit mayn shvester. zi iz avekge- fleg geyn in HOSPITAL

00:25:35.755 --> 00:25:39.613
lernen un, un shtudirn meditsin

00:25:39.619 --> 00:25:42.245
un ikh bin geven mit mayn mamen, aleyn.

00:25:42.454 --> 00:25:49.552
un zeyer veynik hob ikh gehat khaveyrim, vayl, ikh bin avekgeforn fun Sekuren. do hob ikh keynem nisht gekent.

00:25:49.947 --> 00:25:52.871
es iz nisht geven keyn ayngenumene tsayt.

00:25:52.871 --> 00:25:53.568
NO.

00:25:54.148 --> 00:25:56.201
un vos hot ayer mame getun dort?

00:25:56.882 --> 00:26:02.785
mayn mame fleg, d- in Khotin iz geven ir, zi iz dort geboyrn. zi hot gehat ir mishpokhe dortn.

00:26:02.785 --> 00:26:06.118
zi hot gehat shvester dortn un, un eygene

00:26:06.118 --> 00:26:09.206
un zi fleg oykh geyn in di ORGANIZATION.

00:26:09.206 --> 00:26:11.239
mayn mame fleg nisht zitsn on arbet.

00:26:11.239 --> 00:26:12.502
s-

00:26:11.311 --> 00:26:12.655
m'hot ir gelozt?

00:26:14.213 --> 00:26:16.535
s- zi hot gekent rusish perfekt

00:26:17.014 --> 00:26:19.050
un frantseyzish perfekt.

00:26:19.343 --> 00:26:22.099
fleg zi geyn in di orga- s'iz

00:26:22.099 --> 00:26:24.133
s'iz nisht geven teykef vos tsu esn

00:26:24.355 --> 00:26:29.161
nisht azoy vi s'iz geven. m'hot nisht gemakht di shabesn mit di fraytikn, zenen shoyn nisht geven

00:26:29.161 --> 00:26:31.042
vi ⟨for⟩ zenen geven

00:26:31.042 --> 00:26:35.160
zi iz geven zeyer a tikhtike. zi fleg geyn in yeder ORGANIZATION

00:26:35.160 --> 00:26:37.022
un zi fleg oykh zingen

00:26:37.213 --> 00:26:39.738
un me fleg makhn spektaklen

00:26:40.690 --> 00:26:46.674
nor di, di shtimung iz nisht geven azoy vi s'iz geven in Sekuren.

00:26:47.136 --> 00:26:52.007
iz vos hot ir getun ven ir zent, nokh dem vi ir zent gegangen in di shul dort?

00:26:53.008 --> 00:26:53.997
lernen.

00:26:54.713 --> 00:26:57.204
m'hot gemuzt zitsn in der heym un lernen

00:26:57.312 --> 00:27:02.050
un, biz hot di mame hot m- ge- ge- nisht erloybt, hot men nisht getort aroysgeyn in ergets nisht

00:27:02.050 --> 00:27:04.409
un me fleg zikh bagegenen mit der mishpokhe.

00:27:04.568 --> 00:27:06.278
hot ir gehat moyre

00:27:06.278 --> 00:27:08.600
in nayntsn hundert fertsik

00:27:08.600 --> 00:27:12.300
aroystsugeyn in gas ven di rusn zenen arayngekumen tsi nisht?

00:27:14.490 --> 00:27:15.564
s- moyre

00:27:16.093 --> 00:27:18.092
moyre iz veynik tsu zogn

00:27:18.092 --> 00:27:19.247
vayl m'hot t-

00:27:19.247 --> 00:27:23.681
teykef hobn ongehoybn tsu flien di shvartse m- mashinen.

00:27:23.681 --> 00:27:25.925
me fleg n- n- tsunemen mentshn.

00:27:26.337 --> 00:27:30.046
shuldike, yo shuldike, nisht shu- gvirim, kabtsonim

00:27:30.046 --> 00:27:31.663
m'hot geshlept mentshn.

00:27:31.753 --> 00:27:33.266
mayn tate

00:27:32.766 --> 00:27:33.958
vu hot men zey geshlept?

00:27:34.437 --> 00:27:37.316
me fleg zey shlepn in di tfises.

00:27:37.930 --> 00:27:40.236
a sakh zenen geven, mir ho'mir gevoynt

00:27:40.275 --> 00:27:43.509
eygns gegn der, der politsey

00:27:43.954 --> 00:27:46.597
vos iz geven FIRST bay di rumener

00:27:46.688 --> 00:27:51.983
me fleg zey aynzetsn, araynkumen in shtub arayn, aveknemen mentshn.

00:27:51.983 --> 00:27:54.911
zenen ma- ikh gedenk vi mentshn zenen gezesn shoyn

00:27:54.911 --> 00:27:57.333
ongegreyte mit a teshele

00:27:57.333 --> 00:28:00.743
un se fleg zayn a por vesh, a por UNK

00:28:00.743 --> 00:28:02.187
mit a shtikl broyt

00:28:02.187 --> 00:28:04.175
mit, mit a por shikh

00:28:04.175 --> 00:28:06.791
un me fleg vartn az me zol zey kumen tsunemen.

00:28:06.702 --> 00:28:08.994
far vos hobn zey gemeynt, me vet zey kumen nemen?

00:28:06.791 --> 00:28:07.843
mayn

00:28:09.452 --> 00:28:12.301
vayl gvirim

00:28:12.301 --> 00:28:14.610
hot men gedarft farshikn keyn Sibir

00:28:15.747 --> 00:28:21.583
derfar vos zey hobn geheysn az zey zenen geven ⟨EXPLOATAR⟩. zey hobn ekspluatirt di arbets mentshn.
